---
title: Now
layout: base
permalink: /now/
excerpt: "What I'm doing at the moment: work, running, what I'm listening to, and the tech I use."
---

<div class="container page-pad stack-xl">

    <section class="now-intro">
        <div class="now-intro-text">
            <h1 class="page-title">Now</h1>
            <p class="muted">Updated <time datetime="{{ build.date | isoDate }}">{{ build.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
            <p class="lead">This is my <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>: what I'm doing at the moment, rather than everything I've ever done. It was inspired by my colleagues <a href="https://rknight.me/now/">Robb</a> and <a href="https://zoeaubert.me/now/">Zoe</a>, and most of it updates itself every night.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="now-intro-list">
            <h2 class="eyebrow">What I'm up to</h2>
            <ul class="rule-list">
                <li>Leading the engineering team at Radweb as Head of Technology, building Inventory Base and Property Inspect</li>
                <li>Living near Portsmouth with my wife and daughters</li>
                <li>Losing weight through exercise, mostly running and cycling</li>
                <li>Driving our BMW 530e G30 and loving every trip</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="running">
        <h2 id="running" class="section-title">Running, and the weight loss</h2>
        <div class="weight">
            <div class="weight-card">
                <p class="weight-figure">{{ health.weightLoss }}<span> kg</span></p>
                <p>lost since January 2023, through diet and exercise</p>
            </div>
            <div class="weight-text">
                <p><a href="https://www.parkrun.org.uk/parkrunner/8212898/">Parkrun</a> and <a href="https://rwlportsmouth.co.uk/">Run Walk Local</a> have been a huge help, that, and wanting to provide the best life for my family.</p>
                <p>My current routine is commuting twice a week, 30km in total, and running up to 40km a week. I need to put more structure into my training, which currently consists of doing whatever feels about right at the time.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">
            <h3 class="eyebrow">Recent activity</h3>
            <a class="arrow-link" href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/14657730">Follow me on Strava →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="activities">
            {%- for activity in strava.activities %}
                <a class="activity" href="https://www.strava.com/activities/{{ activity.id }}">
                    <div class="activity-media">
                        {% if activity.map.image %}
                            <picture>
                                {% if activity.map.image_dark %}<source srcset="{{ activity.map.image_dark }}" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">{% endif %}
                                <img eleventy:ignore src="{{ activity.map.image }}" alt="Map of {{ activity.name }}" loading="lazy" width="640" height="400">
                            </picture>
                        {% else %}
                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4"></path></svg>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="activity-body">
                        <span class="activity-title">{{ activity.name }}</span>
                        <span class="activity-stats">
                            {%- if activity.distance > 0 %}{{ activity.distance | meters_to_distance }} · {% endif -%}
                            {%- if activity.moving_time > 0 %}{{ activity.moving_time | seconds_to_duration }}{% else %}{{ activity.elapsed_time | seconds_to_duration }}{% endif -%}
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </a>
            {%- endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="numbers">
        <h2 id="numbers" class="section-title">By the numbers</h2>
        <div class="number-panels">
            <div class="number-panel">
                <div class="number-panel-head">
                    <h3>At the keyboard</h3>
                    <span class="muted">All time</span>
                </div>
                <dl class="stat-grid stat-grid-2">
                    <div><dt>GitHub contributions</dt><dd>{% numberFormat github.contributions %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Stack Overflow reputation</dt><dd>{% numberFormat stackoverflow.reputation %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Keys pressed</dt><dd>{% numberFormat whatpulse.keys %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Mouse clicks</dt><dd>{% numberFormat whatpulse.clicks %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Stack Overflow answers</dt><dd>{% numberFormat stackoverflow.answers %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Stack Overflow comments</dt><dd>{% numberFormat stackoverflow.comments %}</dd></div>
                </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="number-panel">
                <div class="number-panel-head">
                    <h3>Away from it</h3>
                    <span class="muted">This month</span>
                </div>
                <dl class="stat-grid stat-grid-2">
                    <div><dt>Steps</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.steps %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>km on foot</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.footDistance %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>km by bike</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.cycleDistance %}</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Floors climbed</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.floorsClimbed %}</dd></div>
                    <div class="stat-sleep">
                        <img eleventy:ignore src="/assets/img/wade-sleeping.svg" alt="" width="96" height="78">
                        <div><dt>Hours slept (weird, I know)</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.hoursSlept %}</dd></div>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="listening">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <h2 id="listening" class="section-title">What I'm listening to</h2>
            <span class="muted">Top this week on <a href="https://www.last.fm/user/iwader">last.fm</a></span>
        </div>
        {% if lastfm.artists.length or lastfm.tracks.length or lastfm.albums.length %}
        <div class="music-grid">
            <div>
                <h3 class="eyebrow">Artists</h3>
                <ol class="ranked-list">
                    {% for artist in lastfm.artists %}<li><a href="{{ artist.url }}">{{ artist.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
                </ol>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="eyebrow">Tracks</h3>
                <ol class="ranked-list">
                    {% for track in lastfm.tracks %}<li><a href="{{ track.url }}">{{ track.name }} <span class="muted">· {{ track.artist['#text'] }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}
                </ol>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="eyebrow">Albums</h3>
                <ol class="ranked-list">
                    {% for album in lastfm.albums %}<li><a href="{{ album.url }}">{{ album.name }} <span class="muted">· {{ album.artist['#text'] }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <p class="muted">Nothing scrobbled yet this week. Check back in a few days.</p>
        {% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="tech">
        <h2 id="tech" class="section-title">What I'm using</h2>
        <ul class="chip-list">
            <li>MacBook Pro 16" M2 Max, 64GB, 1TB</li>
            <li>iPhone 17 Pro Max</li>
            <li>Apple Watch Series 8, 45mm</li>
            <li>Apple Magic Keyboard with Touch ID</li>
            <li>Logitech MX Master 3S</li>
            <li>AirPods Pro</li>
            <li>Shokz OpenRun Pro 2</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted">The apps I use every day are in <a href="/posts/2023/11/app-defaults/">App Defaults</a>.</p>
    </section>
</div>
